{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Vertical Slice.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Vertical Slice.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"vertical slice vertical slice","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Vertical Slice.md","fileName":"Vertical Slice.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Vertical Slice","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 14:36\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Game Production Planning and Milestones]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Production Planning and Milestones","Prototype","Tracer Bullet","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agilegamedevelopment2e.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Vertical Slice.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Vertical Slice.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"vertical slice vertical slice","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Vertical Slice.md","fileName":"Vertical Slice.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Vertical Slice","heading":"Vertical Slice","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A vertical slice is a polished sample in which representative layers of a game work together, from interface and art through gameplay systems and supporting technology. It demonstrates how the finished experience may appear to stakeholders.\n\nUnlike a fast [[Prototype]], it requires polish and broad integration, so it is expensive and can distract from unresolved core design questions. Completing one also does not make the rest of an innovative game a merely linear content-production task.\n\nA smaller [[Tracer Bullet]] can reduce end-to-end technical uncertainty before this level of polish is justified. Both forms gain their value from crossing component boundaries, not from demonstrating isolated task completion.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Production Planning and Milestones","Prototype","Tracer Bullet","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agilegamedevelopment2e.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Vertical Slice.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Vertical Slice.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"vertical slice vertical slice","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Vertical Slice.md","fileName":"Vertical Slice.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Vertical Slice","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[advancedgamedesign.pdf]]\n[[agilegamedevelopment2e.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Production Planning and Milestones","Prototype","Tracer Bullet","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agilegamedevelopment2e.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}